### Authentication Endpoints

# Check authentication status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/status
Authorization: Bearer test-api-token-123456789

###

# Get QR code for authentication
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/qrcode
Authorization: Bearer test-api-token-123456789

###

# Authenticate with phone number
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/phone/1234567890
Authorization: Bearer test-api-token-123456789

###

# Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer test-api-token-123456789

###

### Chat Endpoints

# Send text message using multipart form
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat/send
Authorization: Bearer test-api-token-123456789
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phone"

1234567890
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="text"

Hello from Rust WhatsApp Engine with improved multipart API!
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###

# Send message with file attachment
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat/send
Authorization: Bearer test-api-token-123456789
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phone"

1234567890
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="text"

Check this image attachment!
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

(binary file content would go here)
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###

# Send only file without text
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat/send
Authorization: Bearer test-api-token-123456789
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phone"

1234567890
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

(binary file content would go here)
------WebKitFormBoundary--
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /path/to/your/test/image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###
